Job Title: Junior Software Engineer (Data Analyst)

Company: Vir Ltd.

Location: Ahmedabad

Experience: 0-2 Years

Working days: Monday to Saturday

Job Overview:

We are looking for a detail-oriented and analytical Junior Software Engineer (Data Analyst) to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for collecting, processing, and analyzing data to support business decisions. This role requires strong data handling skills and a basic understanding of data security and web scraping techniques.

Key Responsibilities:

● Collect, extract, and interpret data from various sources

● Perform data abstraction, filtering, and data management tasks

● Develop and maintain datasets for analysis and reporting

● Conduct web scraping to gather relevant information

● Ensure data accuracy, consistency, and security

● Assist in generating reports and dashboards for business insights

● Collaborate with internal teams to understand data requirements

Required Skills:

● Strong understanding of data abstraction and data filtering techniques

● Knowledge of data management and handling large datasets

● Basic experience in web scraping tools or techniques

● Understanding of data security principles

● Proficiency in Excel, SQL, or any data analysis tools (preferred)

● Good analytical and problem-solving skills

Eligibility Criteria:

● Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field

● 0–2 years of experience in data analysis or a related role

● Freshers with relevant skills are encouraged to apply

